224
00:17:47,072 --> 00:17:51,956
Answer out loud, and draw the table as you
speak. A strong answer derives each row

225
00:17:51,996 --> 00:17:56,940
from the three steps of a reset, so that
the table is the consequence of a rule and

226
00:17:56,980 --> 00:18:01,804
not a list. It gets the status letters
right, including the row where the letters

227
00:18:01,844 --> 00:18:06,488
